#created by Duel Circuit - Return Rook (Chaos Return, 2005)
#era 2005
#tier Alley headliner (docs/dev/HEADLINERS-2026-11-01.md)
#about Dimensional Fissure banishes everything that goes to the Graveyard, so every Foolish Burial and every discard banks a monster; Chaos Sorcerer and Black Luster Soldier bank more. Then Return from the Different Dimension brings every one of them back at once: two or more of his own monsters home for one attack.
#why Return from the Different Dimension and Dimension Fusion are Forbidden today; in April 2005 both were legal at three, and Chaos Return was the comeback deck of its year.
#source Authored for the Back Alley from the 2005 Chaos Return lists: three Return, two Dimension Fusion, three Dimensional Fissure and three Foolish Burial to bank Zaborg, Jinzo and the Thunder Dragons, Chaos Sorcerer and BLS beside them
#banlist TCG April 2005
